<view class="page tool-page metro-page"><view class="page-head"><view class="tool-title"><text class="title">节拍器</text><text class="desc">BPM 调速 · 拍号重音 · 跟拍练习</text></view><view class="tool-icon green"><image src="/assets/icons/metronome.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view></view><view class="metro-face"><view class="metro-pendulum {{running ? 'running' : ''}}" style="animation-duration:{{swingDuration}}s;"><view></view></view><text class="metro-bpm">{{bpm}}</text><text class="metro-unit">BPM · {{beats}} / 4</text><view class="metro-beats"><view wx:for="{{beatMarkers}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{currentBeat === item ? 'active' : ''}} {{index === 0 ? 'accent' : ''}}"></view></view></view><view class="metro-adjust"><button data-delta="-1" bindtap="adjustBpm">−</button><slider min="30" max="240" step="1" value="{{bpm}}" bindchanging="changeBpm" bindchange="changeBpm" activeColor="#25B76A" backgroundColor="#DFE9E4" block-size="22"/><button data-delta="1" bindtap="adjustBpm">＋</button></view><view class="card metro-panel"><view class="metro-label-row"><text>拍号</text><text>首拍自动重音</text></view><view class="metro-signatures"><button wx:for="{{signatures}}" wx:key="*this" data-beats="{{item}}" bindtap="selectSignature" class="{{beats === item ? 'active' : ''}}">{{item}} / 4</button></view><view class="metro-switch"><view><text>提示音</text><text>本机生成短音，不使用网络音频</text></view><switch checked="{{sound}}" bindchange="toggleSound" color="#25B76A"/></view><view class="metro-switch"><view><text>节拍振动</text><text>每拍轻振，首拍振动更明显</text></view><switch checked="{{vibration}}" bindchange="toggleVibration" color="#25B76A"/></view><text wx:if="{{audioNote}}" class="metro-audio-note">{{audioNote}}</text></view><view class="metro-actions"><button class="metro-tap" bindtap="tapTempo"><text>点击测速</text><text>{{tapHint}}</text></button><button class="metro-main {{running ? 'stop' : ''}}" bindtap="toggle"><text>{{running ? '停止' : '开始'}}</text></button></view><view class="page-foot-tip"><view class="privacy-line"><image class="privacy-icon" src="/assets/icons/success.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="privacy-copy">本地计时与发声，不上传练习数据</text></view><text class="privacy-detail">切到后台后节拍会停止，返回页面可重新开始</text></view></view>
